      "fold_score_key": "d1_orig (E235 re-saved -distance); score = -d1_orig",
      "purpose": "alignment-applied EEG score = the E233 mean_align Test score (frozen). Ref = deploy inner-OOF known scores. LOSO = frozen per-fold scores, unaligned, identical to E233."
    },
